  "title": "Air Fryer Apple Crisp",
  "description": "Warm apple crisp screams fall, and using an air fryer is ideal for a small portion. Any variety of apple works. Top with ice cream for more indulgence.",
  "authors": [
    "Kim's Cooking Now"
  ],
