  "ingredients": [
    "0.5 teaspoon butter",
    "2 cups diced apples",
    "3 tablespoons water",
    "0.5 tablespoon white sugar",
    "0.5 teaspoon ground cinnamon",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "2 tablespoons rolled oats",
    "2 tablespoons all-purpose flour",
    "2 tablespoons brown sugar",
    "1 tablespoon melted butter"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients. Preheat an air fryer to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C) according to manufacturer's instructions.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WRCv3nSli2utc8LBogl7GnovVmA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-281911-air-fryer-apple-crisp-VAT-step-01-4288378f8871486d82070d6fc7145be1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281911/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Butter a small oven-safe dish that will fit into the air fryer.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/55ZHFfiQE12UaVElnn0Poh320dc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-281911-air-fryer-apple-crisp-VAT-step-02-0057cc403d2c4e299c8b96fe0a3858c2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281911/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine apples, water, sugar, cinnamon, and salt in a small bowl. Add to the prepared dish and cover tightly with aluminum foil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/7CuV7zF-ZWoGVxVi9x_Yq2S5Ayk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-281911-air-fryer-apple-crisp-VAT-step-03-2583979dcfde47099c64f948308178f0.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281911/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place the dish inside the air fryer and set the timer for 10 minutes. Remove the foil and stir. Replace foil and set timer for another 10 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/uf2oZbu_UsKPhcLdMfFPrIcxH6E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-281911-air-fryer-apple-crisp-VAT-step-04-ffd92d9b1e3940cdb7ba9e1daf14c8cd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281911/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, combine rolled oats, flour, brown sugar, and butter in a small bowl. Mix with a fork until crumbly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/K8Ho4qXvkQFQoVISUoZ3H8zrJ9s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-281911-air-fryer-apple-crisp-VAT-step-05-d56dccc14f3345dab3e9ee2d02b5f463.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281911/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Open the air fryer and remove the foil. Sprinkle topping on apples. Close the air fryer and set the timer for 5 minutes. Remove apple crisp from the air fryer and cool slightly.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4dhIoyX1Z-LMXjno7TOr0BzSt4U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-281911-air-fryer-apple-crisp-VAT-step-06-1b1f64e95d1b42ef848d7d1ed689519d.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/281911/step_06.webp"
    }
